{
    "_doc": "Session commands of Job_MediaSession (a group movie / game session - RecreationActivity.requireMedia, Docs/Utnapishtim_Activities/Plan_UtnapishtimActivities.md). The job builds one in its room for each participant, in a package of their own, and issues it again each time it finishes - short, so anyone can break for a need and rejoin. Silent: no begin / ongoing / remove / after lines, so a session of several hours doesn't flood the log (the session's own start / end events tell the story). Not furniture commands (no 'furniture' tag) - never offered by furniture to the ordinary sandbox. joinAlone: the player joining one drags no target or teammates along.",
